<title>USA: Multimedia Games Inc FY96 Sept 30 EPS loss.</title>
<headline>Multimedia Games Inc FY96 Sept 30 EPS loss.</headline>
<dateline>TULSA, Okla. 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996		     1995</p>
<p>		     YEAR</p>
<p> Shr	  loss	  $0.04   profit	 $0.24</p>
<p> Net	profit	     40   profit	   505</p>
<p> Revs			23,000		   15,500</p>
<p> Avg shrs			NA			 NA</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Fiscal 1996 per share net loss after an unspecified amount of preferred dividends.</p>
<p>Fourth quarter results were not given.</p>
<p>The company said revenues rose largely due to its MegaMania bingo game that was launched in March/April 1996. MegaMania revenues were about $6.1 million during fiscal 1996.</p>
